WEBVTT

00:01:33.860 --> 00:01:38.360
It didn't matter if Jyuusan-hime and I were actually assassinated.

00:01:38.960 --> 00:01:40.470
I still need to go somewhere.

00:01:42.370 --> 00:01:45.000
Ensei! Come with me to the Imperial Residence!

00:01:45.000 --> 00:01:46.620
Seiga, go to the prison!

00:01:46.620 --> 00:01:48.290
To the prison?

00:01:48.290 --> 00:01:49.790
Tan-tan will be there too.

00:02:23.280 --> 00:02:26.210
You're late, Shuuei-nii-sama.

00:02:28.290 --> 00:02:30.470
Isn't the star supposed to perform the closing act?

00:02:32.150 --> 00:02:34.290
I was looking for someone.

00:02:34.290 --> 00:02:38.050
If you were looking for the Emperor,
I told him not to come, no matter what happens.

00:02:56.430 --> 00:02:57.820
Ensei, hurry!

00:02:57.820 --> 00:02:59.560
Jyuusan-hime's in danger!

00:02:59.560 --> 00:03:00.490
All right!

00:03:00.490 --> 00:03:03.700
As always, you don't take matters seriously enough!

00:03:13.610 --> 00:03:17.020
Whoa, they really came to attack!

00:03:22.470 --> 00:03:23.680
I get it.

00:03:23.680 --> 00:03:28.350
They planned to take advantage of the chaos and
let the prisoners who would join their side escape.

00:03:29.850 --> 00:03:32.490
So Shuurei anticipated this, huh?

00:03:33.590 --> 00:03:35.770
Arrest every single one of them!

00:03:35.770 --> 00:03:36.880
Right!

00:04:12.970 --> 00:04:13.890
Jin.

00:04:14.920 --> 00:04:15.880
No,

00:04:15.880 --> 00:04:16.770
I'm Shun.

00:04:16.770 --> 00:04:18.520
Cut the crap, you bastard!

00:04:18.900 --> 00:04:20.780
What are you doing here?!

00:04:20.780 --> 00:04:22.360
Why are you the one who came?!

00:04:22.360 --> 00:04:23.770
Why?!

00:04:23.770 --> 00:04:25.900
You know why. Isn't that why you waited?

00:04:27.450 --> 00:04:28.700
Hotaru...

00:04:31.430 --> 00:04:33.950
You find your name boring?

00:04:33.950 --> 00:04:35.620
Then I'll give you another.

00:04:37.570 --> 00:04:40.940
You're like a firefly, so you're Hotaru.

00:04:42.970 --> 00:04:44.130
Hotaru?

00:04:44.130 --> 00:04:45.530
That's right.

00:04:45.930 --> 00:04:47.150
You're Hotaru.

00:04:52.140 --> 00:04:54.300
Don't make me laugh.

00:04:54.300 --> 00:04:59.150
Even if you had to play the fool and show up, why are you an assassin, of all things?

00:04:59.640 --> 00:05:02.650
I'm no longer a member of the Shiba family.

00:05:03.420 --> 00:05:05.650
Shiba Jin is dead.

00:05:05.650 --> 00:05:07.500
He's gone now.

00:05:10.210 --> 00:05:12.240
That's not right, Jin.

00:05:13.410 --> 00:05:15.240
What's not?

00:05:15.240 --> 00:05:17.710
You <i>are</i> a member of the Shiba family.

00:05:17.710 --> 00:05:19.760
My brothers think so too.

00:05:20.920 --> 00:05:27.430
That's why they chose Jyuusan-hime and sent her to the Imperial Residence while you were in Kiyou:

00:05:27.810 --> 00:05:29.720
to make her the wife of the Emperor.

00:05:30.980 --> 00:05:32.420
The Emperor, huh?

00:05:32.420 --> 00:05:34.380
He's a good Emperor, isn't he?

00:05:34.380 --> 00:05:38.730
When I heard he might take Hotaru as his wife,
I went to see what kind of man he was.

00:05:39.690 --> 00:05:43.970
He noticed I was there, but he ignored me because I wasn't threatening his life.

00:05:43.970 --> 00:05:48.240
I think you'd be happy with that Emperor, Hotaru.

00:05:49.490 --> 00:05:50.410
And you too.

00:05:51.560 --> 00:05:55.020
I can tell what you want.

00:05:57.430 --> 00:06:00.330
That's why you went to see Shuurei-dono?

00:06:00.330 --> 00:06:03.930
She's just as lively and clever as Hotaru.

00:06:05.720 --> 00:06:10.920
Jin, if everyone finds out that the chief assassin
behind these killings was a son of the Shiba family,

00:06:10.920 --> 00:06:14.310
the leading family among all subordinate families of Ran...

00:06:14.310 --> 00:06:17.310
It would affect the Ran family, huh?

00:06:17.310 --> 00:06:19.130
If the Section of Government Inspection finds out,

00:06:19.130 --> 00:06:21.810
then they'll finally have something on the Ran family.

00:06:21.810 --> 00:06:23.720
If you know all that, then...

00:06:23.720 --> 00:06:27.340
Like I said, I'm not a member of the Shiba family anymore.

00:06:27.820 --> 00:06:30.120
Shiba Jin is dead.

00:06:30.120 --> 00:06:32.910
He was executed five years ago... That's right.

00:06:33.330 --> 00:06:35.450
I'm just "Shun" now.

00:06:36.080 --> 00:06:39.200
Shun, who gave you that name?

00:06:40.520 --> 00:06:42.100
I'm not telling you that.

00:06:42.100 --> 00:06:45.190
You were always a bit stupid, in some ways.

00:06:46.150 --> 00:06:50.050
If you're saying that Jin, who was my best friend, has died...

00:06:51.250 --> 00:06:53.200
Don't use Jin's words!

00:06:56.590 --> 00:07:00.100
That's right! We're finally talking, Shuuei!

00:07:01.190 --> 00:07:02.850
Watch the assassins.

00:07:03.510 --> 00:07:07.060
Whatever he says, his only objective is to let them escape!

00:07:07.980 --> 00:07:09.600
You don't get confused about priorities, do you?

00:07:09.600 --> 00:07:12.810
Who do you think is standing in front of you?

00:07:14.800 --> 00:07:20.060
The only man I ever approved of, but still second to me!

00:07:20.370 --> 00:07:21.920
Find that out for yourself!

00:07:37.170 --> 00:07:39.820
You've learned the moves of the Koku family, Shuuei.

00:07:39.820 --> 00:07:42.230
You've been trained by a fine master.

00:07:42.550 --> 00:07:45.630
You're much stronger now that your bad habits are gone.

00:07:45.630 --> 00:07:50.530
Maybe I haven't grown strong; perhaps you've grown weak.

00:07:50.530 --> 00:07:53.400
You can joke when you win!

00:08:22.430 --> 00:08:23.520
She's incredibly strong!

00:08:36.820 --> 00:08:38.130
Shusui-dono?!
Shusui-san?!

00:08:43.270 --> 00:08:44.230
Shusui-dono?

00:08:44.230 --> 00:08:45.100
Stop!

00:08:45.100 --> 00:08:46.750
Untie our men first!

00:09:07.370 --> 00:09:09.790
It seems we were just in time!

00:09:11.350 --> 00:09:12.660
Shusui!

00:09:19.170 --> 00:09:21.550
Sh-Shuurei-sama...

00:09:21.550 --> 00:09:26.450
His Highness... my... apologies...

00:09:27.310 --> 00:09:30.220
I cannot stay... beside you...

00:09:32.650 --> 00:09:35.070
Shouka... sama...

00:09:48.490 --> 00:09:49.910
Shusui-dono...

00:09:52.180 --> 00:09:55.820
Jin, what's going on?! I'll kill you if you don't answer!

00:09:58.740 --> 00:10:00.450
That's it.

00:10:04.830 --> 00:10:05.660
Jin!

00:10:09.100 --> 00:10:12.540
If you want to finish it, then come after me.

00:11:02.330 --> 00:11:06.070
If you don't want to die, then leave the woman behind.

00:11:07.010 --> 00:11:09.190
You must be Kokurou.

00:11:09.190 --> 00:11:11.230
You were really still in the palace?

00:11:11.870 --> 00:11:13.980
What good will it do if I leave this woman behind?

00:11:13.980 --> 00:11:16.260
The same thing will happen all over again.

00:11:16.730 --> 00:11:21.460
I hear she's been under this hypnotic spell since her birth.

00:11:21.910 --> 00:11:25.130
Now that it's been activated, she'll never be free again.

00:11:25.130 --> 00:11:27.240
She'll be under its control until she dies.

00:11:27.640 --> 00:11:31.060
She's better off staying with me instead of in the palace.

00:11:31.060 --> 00:11:35.410
I can stop her from assassinating anyone.

00:11:35.950 --> 00:11:38.650
Why are you doing something so stupid?

00:11:39.330 --> 00:11:42.760
I wouldn't have thought that Kokurou, of all people, would ask me that.

00:11:43.450 --> 00:11:47.050
I didn't hesitate, but you did.

00:11:47.630 --> 00:11:53.380
You were given the order, but you didn't want to kill Jyuusan-hime, your former fiancée.

00:11:53.380 --> 00:11:55.980
That's why you told Ran Shuuei to come.

00:11:56.640 --> 00:11:58.680
If you have doubts, then stop now.

00:12:01.960 --> 00:12:03.660
So you know everything?

00:12:04.060 --> 00:12:06.600
However, I don't intend to betray anyone.

00:12:06.600 --> 00:12:09.540
Even if that means you lose your best friend and your fiancée?

00:12:09.540 --> 00:12:14.920
Shiba Jin is dead. What can a dead man lose?

00:12:14.920 --> 00:12:19.370
However, there's something that even a ghost can do.

00:12:19.960 --> 00:12:21.420
Something you can do?

00:12:21.420 --> 00:12:24.600
Yeah, it will all be over once I've done that.

00:12:25.930 --> 00:12:27.300
Can I go now?

00:12:42.840 --> 00:12:45.070
I'll leave her to you for now.

00:12:45.680 --> 00:12:47.400
Treat her with great care.

00:12:47.400 --> 00:12:48.830
I know.

00:12:50.400 --> 00:12:54.160
I'll also do my best to find a way to undo the hypnosis.

00:13:13.560 --> 00:13:18.400
Someone has been quietly removing
condemned convicts over the years,

00:13:18.400 --> 00:13:21.330
and using them as assassins?

00:13:22.280 --> 00:13:23.550
Is that your view?

00:13:23.550 --> 00:13:24.220
Yes, sir.

00:13:24.220 --> 00:13:27.200
They become assassins as payment for escaping execution.

00:13:27.200 --> 00:13:31.160
That's the truth behind the rumors about ghosts appearing from the prisons.

00:13:31.160 --> 00:13:34.970
People who saw the assassins thought that they were the ghosts of executed criminals.

00:13:34.970 --> 00:13:36.830
Is that correct?

00:13:36.830 --> 00:13:37.800
Yes, sir.

00:13:37.800 --> 00:13:41.350
It appears that the Vice Minister of Arms was involved in the plot as well.

00:13:41.350 --> 00:13:46.070
Needless to say, the man who recruited the
condemned convicts was probably someone else.

00:13:48.570 --> 00:13:52.040
Then again, the Vice Minister was murdered to ensure his silence.

00:13:52.040 --> 00:13:53.780
This isn't over yet.

00:13:54.820 --> 00:13:56.810
Someone is behind all this.

00:13:57.150 --> 00:13:58.470
Director General Ki—

00:13:57.660 --> 00:13:59.560
Don't be impertinent!

00:14:01.520 --> 00:14:03.100
I haven't said anything!

00:14:03.100 --> 00:14:04.890
This case is now closed.

00:14:04.890 --> 00:14:06.110
But—

00:14:06.110 --> 00:14:11.620
The low-ranking assassins who've been arrested won't know anything about the ringleaders.

00:14:13.380 --> 00:14:15.950
I hear that you've spoken to the leader of the assassins.

00:14:16.590 --> 00:14:17.620
Yes.

00:14:17.620 --> 00:14:21.670
That man... He's related to the Ran family, isn't he?

00:14:26.810 --> 00:14:28.040
No.

00:14:29.050 --> 00:14:30.840
How can you tell?

00:14:33.900 --> 00:14:35.060
Kou Shuurei,

00:14:35.060 --> 00:14:38.930
if you're letting your sentimentality and preconceptions affect your opinion, then I'll fire you immediately.

00:14:38.930 --> 00:14:44.360
Our job is to doubt everyone, no matter if it's your family or your lover.

00:14:45.440 --> 00:14:47.900
Even... your superior?

00:14:48.300 --> 00:14:53.640
My superior has enormous influence over the prisons and the court.

00:14:53.640 --> 00:14:55.910
Perhaps he's involved too.

00:14:56.560 --> 00:14:58.790
Of course, doubt him.

00:14:58.790 --> 00:15:04.830
Your superior is far more experienced and good at covering his tracks.

00:15:04.830 --> 00:15:07.190
Keep your eyes wide open.

00:15:07.640 --> 00:15:09.760
This case is now closed.

00:15:09.760 --> 00:15:14.360
The Vice Minister not only used his assassins to murder provincial officials,

00:15:14.360 --> 00:15:16.420
he also plotted to kill Jyuusan-hime,

00:15:16.420 --> 00:15:18.640
so that his own daughter could enter the Imperial Residence.

00:15:18.640 --> 00:15:20.530
He failed and died.

00:15:20.530 --> 00:15:21.720
That's all.

00:15:21.720 --> 00:15:22.810
Please hold on!

00:15:22.810 --> 00:15:25.450
I said, "That's all."

00:15:25.450 --> 00:15:28.190
If you can't accept it, then resign.

00:15:28.880 --> 00:15:32.360
Or become more powerful than me.

00:15:37.660 --> 00:15:38.870
Report to me.

00:15:38.870 --> 00:15:39.890
Yes, sir.

00:15:39.890 --> 00:15:42.160
The other case involving the Vice Minister of Arms

00:15:42.160 --> 00:15:44.320
is basically the same as the condemned convicts' case.

00:15:44.320 --> 00:15:47.440
He recruited soldiers who'd been dismissed for disobeying orders,

00:15:47.440 --> 00:15:51.170
and turned the competent ones into assassins.

00:15:51.760 --> 00:15:55.950
Presumably, the Vice Minister used
those assassins for private purposes,

00:15:55.950 --> 00:15:59.520
offended someone by doing so, and was punished severely.

00:16:00.860 --> 00:16:03.770
So even you want to meddle with the highest-ranking officials?

00:16:04.070 --> 00:16:08.780
If so, I'll do it better than that woman.

00:16:10.000 --> 00:16:12.730
That woman picked up on the condemned convicts,

00:16:12.730 --> 00:16:15.760
and you picked up on the soldiers from the Ministry of Arms.

00:16:15.760 --> 00:16:17.660
It was a close contest, wasn't it?

00:16:19.400 --> 00:16:21.310
Interesting, isn't it?

00:16:26.710 --> 00:16:32.170
Somewhere, someone is forming a group of assassins,

00:16:32.750 --> 00:16:35.710
as if to mimic the "Wolves of the Wind."

00:16:54.530 --> 00:16:56.820
Kouyuu, what about your work?

00:16:56.820 --> 00:16:58.170
I escaped.

00:16:59.880 --> 00:17:01.330
What are you planning to do?

00:17:05.680 --> 00:17:10.450
Kouyuu, do you know what makes you and me fundamentally different?

00:17:10.450 --> 00:17:13.990
Don't be stupid. We're different in every way.

00:17:13.990 --> 00:17:15.090
True.

00:17:15.980 --> 00:17:20.630
I'm a man of the Ran family,
but you don't belong to the Kou family.

00:17:20.630 --> 00:17:21.880
That's the difference.

00:17:23.650 --> 00:17:26.350
You have that strength, and I don't.

00:17:30.920 --> 00:17:34.440
You're not a member of the Kou family.

00:17:34.440 --> 00:17:37.640
In contrast, I've been a member of the Ran family since my birth.

00:17:39.590 --> 00:17:43.640
Kouyuu, I've already made up my mind.

00:17:44.150 --> 00:17:46.250
You just need to stay at the Emperor's side.

00:17:47.080 --> 00:17:50.390
However, I can't anymore.

00:17:52.930 --> 00:17:54.050
The last two years...

00:17:56.910 --> 00:17:58.290
Only two years...

00:18:01.010 --> 00:18:02.770
A very long two years...

00:18:05.910 --> 00:18:07.410
They were fun.

00:18:09.870 --> 00:18:12.870
Still, we can't just keep on having fun.

00:18:34.870 --> 00:18:39.300
As promised, may I have a bout with you, Your Highness?

00:18:47.620 --> 00:18:48.660
How many times?

00:18:49.940 --> 00:18:53.940
How many times have I forced the Emperor to make that face?

00:18:55.730 --> 00:19:00.680
How many times have I made him sigh at night?

00:19:02.790 --> 00:19:04.780
How many times...

00:19:04.780 --> 00:19:08.610
have I hurt this kind Emperor?

00:19:11.700 --> 00:19:12.750
Here I come.

00:19:26.510 --> 00:19:31.050
Ryuuki is serious, but Ran-shogun isn't.

00:19:31.050 --> 00:19:33.020
Things have come this far, yet he's still...

00:20:05.770 --> 00:20:07.420
I give in.

00:20:08.420 --> 00:20:10.080
This is my answer.

00:20:10.080 --> 00:20:13.980
Your Highness, you deserve someone better than me.

00:20:14.810 --> 00:20:18.920
Please take my sister, Jyuusan-hime, as your wife,

00:20:18.920 --> 00:20:20.680
along with the name of Ran.

00:20:42.720 --> 00:20:45.610
The iris sword that Your Highness presented to me,

00:20:46.340 --> 00:20:50.220
and the honor that went with it,
exceed my unworthy merits.

00:20:50.570 --> 00:20:55.140
Ran Shuuei, as of now, wishes to return the iris sword to His Highness,

00:20:55.140 --> 00:20:57.530
along with his rank as General of the Left Urin Army.

00:20:57.530 --> 00:21:01.100
With that, he asks His Highness for his gracious permission to return to Ranshuu.

00:21:26.910 --> 00:21:31.050
I don't want my last memory to be of you covered in sweat.

00:21:34.710 --> 00:21:36.000
Do as you wish.

00:21:49.530 --> 00:21:50.950
Finally...

00:22:33.620 --> 00:22:34.670
Your Highness.

00:22:49.720 --> 00:22:51.830
I don't want any comforting.

00:22:51.830 --> 00:22:54.380
Then, what do you want?

00:22:58.000 --> 00:22:59.920
Ran Shuuei.

00:23:02.450 --> 00:23:04.630
I will grant your wish.

00:23:04.630 --> 00:23:07.900
My lord, I have come here for that.

00:23:12.420 --> 00:23:15.200
Yuushun, take care of the Imperial Court for me!

00:23:16.220 --> 00:23:17.740
Yes, Your Highness.

00:23:20.520 --> 00:23:23.820
I'll go and get what I want myself!

00:23:25.050 --> 00:23:28.120
I can go and get it... Ran Shuuei!

00:24:45.350 --> 00:24:47.130
Farewell, Ran-shogun.

00:24:47.130 --> 00:24:50.840
This is serious! Seiga is closing the main gates and checkpoints!

00:24:50.840 --> 00:24:54.430
He's planning to catch Ran-shogun and question him about that assassin!

00:24:54.430 --> 00:24:56.510
Like I'd let Seiga do as he wants!
